 gist: "The caches become two layers, a living tree agents edit to keep true and an append-only journal of what was seen or made on a day, entered from one root and one door, with surfaces that carry less prose and address by anchor."
 touches: [~".spw/caches", ~".spw/workspace.spw", ~"scripts/analyzers/spw-cut-gate.ts"]
 entry: ~"./PLAN.md"
 next: "~[shelf_entry]: move the 13 raw topic folders and the shelf index into journal/2026-09-30-gemini-shelf as pure renames, then repoint lineage strings."
}

