^["intent"]{
 ~#goal: "An agent that lands in the caches finds one root, one extension door, and one gate command. A surface goes in the tree when a later agent should edit it to keep it true, and in the journal when it records what was seen or made on a day. Surfaces spend their characters on claims, not on paths, receipts, and repeated card fields."
 ~#taste: "indexability and thrift: one signal per wire, address by anchor, derive what can be derived; the tree is a view over the journal and the sources"
}

